---
// 《宇宙漫游》— 从地球出发的太阳系 3D 飞行。真实轨道根数驱动。
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="宇宙漫游 · 玩具展馆"
  description="从地球出发，驾驶视角漫游真实轨道参数构建的太阳系：八行星与冥王星按 J2000 轨道根数运行，土星环、小行星带、流星与五个漂浮彩蛋。WASD 或双摇杆航行。"
>
  <script is:inline>
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  </script>

  <div class="void">
    <canvas id="stage" aria-label="宇宙漫游 — 三维太阳系"></canvas>

    <!-- 天体标签层（场景投影定位） -->
    <div class="labels" id="labels" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="hud" id="hud">
      <a class="hud__back" href="/">← <span>大厅</span></a>

      <div class="hud__title shown">
        <span class="hud__no">展品 之 二十七</span>
        <h1>宇宙漫游<span class="hud__seal" aria-hidden="true"></span></h1>
        <span class="hud__en">V O Y A G E &nbsp; T H R O U G H &nbsp; T H E &nbsp; S O L A R &nbsp; S Y S T E M</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 左上：天体导航（折叠菜单，缩放展开） -->
      <div class="dockwrap">
        <button class="hud__fold-btn" id="btn-dock" aria-expanded="false" title="天体导航：一键飞往">⊕ 天体</button>
        <nav class="hud__dock" id="dock" aria-label="天体导航"></nav>
      </div>

      <!-- 右上：功能菜单（折叠，缩放展开） -->
      <div class="menuwrap">
        <button class="hud__fold-btn right" id="btn-menu" aria-expanded="false" title="功能菜单">☰ 菜单</button>
        <div class="hud__menu" id="menu">
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-theater" aria-pressed="false" title="旅行者剧场：90 秒自动叙事，直到缩放到银河（V 键）">剧场</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-tour" aria-pressed="false" title="巡航模式：自动逐站漫游太阳系（任意手动操作即退出）">巡航</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-light" aria-pressed="false" title="光速航行：以真空光速前进，用等待体会距离（L 键）">光速航行</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-sling" title="引力弹弓：向最近天体借一记切向加速（G 键）">引力弹弓</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-photo" title="拍照：导出带位置水印的 PNG（P 键）">拍照</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-beauty" aria-pressed="false" title="画面调节：光晕 / 转速 / 显示项">画面调节</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-time" title="宇宙时间流速（T 键切换）">6时/秒</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-sound" aria-pressed="false" title="环境音">声音 · 关</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-cinema" aria-pressed="false" title="壁纸模式：隐藏全部界面（H 键）">壁纸</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-gyro" aria-pressed="false" title="陀螺仪：转动手机环顾深空" hidden>陀螺仪</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-full" title="全屏">全屏</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="beauty" id="beauty" hidden>
        <p class="beauty__tune">光</p>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>太阳光</span><input type="range" id="be-sun" min="0.4" max="2" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>辉光</span><input type="range" id="be-bloom" min="0" max="1.6" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>Halo</span><input type="range" id="be-halo" min="0" max="1.5" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>大气</span><input type="range" id="be-atmo" min="0.4" max="1.6" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <p class="beauty__tune">动</p>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>转速</span><input type="range" id="be-spin" min="0" max="5" step="0.1" value="1"><b>1.0×</b></label>
        <p class="beauty__tune">示</p>
        <label class="beauty__row check"><span>天体文字</span><input type="checkbox" id="be-labels" checked></label>
        <label class="beauty__row check"><span>碎石带</span><input type="checkbox" id="be-belt" checked></label>
        <label class="beauty__row check"><span>轨道线</span><input type="checkbox" id="be-orbits" checked></label>
      </div>

      <!-- 行星导航坞（由左上折叠按钮展开） -->

      <div class="hud__clock">
        <span class="hud__speed" id="hud-speed">航速 26 u/s</span>
        <span class="hud__near" id="hud-near"></span>
        <span class="hud__date muted" id="hud-date"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="hud__score" id="hud-score"></div>

      <div class="hud__hint shown" id="hud-hint">
        <b>WASD</b> 航行 · <b>拖拽</b> 视角 · <b>滚轮</b> 调速 · 空格/Q 上升 · C 下降 · Shift 加速 · <b>V</b> 剧场 · <b>H</b> 壁纸 · 点击行星前往
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 信息卡 -->
    <aside class="card" id="info-card" hidden>
      <button class="card__close" id="card-close" aria-label="关闭">×</button>
      <h2 id="card-name"></h2>
      <p class="card__en" id="card-en"></p>
      <p class="card__desc" id="card-desc"></p>
      <dl id="card-data"></dl>
      <ul class="card__facts" id="card-facts"></ul>
      <button class="card__go" id="card-go">→ 自动前往</button>
    </aside>

    <!-- 发现彩蛋 toast -->
    <div class="discovery" id="discovery" hidden>
      <span class="discovery__tag">发现</span>
      <b id="discovery-name"></b>
      <p id="discovery-line"></p>
    </div>

    <!-- 航速 toast -->
    <div class="speed-toast" id="speed-toast"></div>
    <div class="theater-cap" id="theater-cap" aria-live="polite"></div>

    <!-- 横屏提示（触屏竖屏时） -->
    <div class="rotate" id="rotate">
      <p>⟳</p>
      <p>请横屏驾驶</p>
    </div>

    <div class="veil" id="veil">
      <div class="veil__orbit"><i></i></div>
      <p class="veil__text">正在展开宇宙…</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fatal" id="fatal" hidden>
      <p>引擎未能点火。</p>
      <p class="muted small" id="fatal-msg"></p>
      <a class="hud__btn" href="/">← 回到大厅</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  html, body { background: #04040a !important; overflow: hidden; }
  /* 天体标签：场景动态创建，样式全局 */
  .labels { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 8; }
  .cosmos-label {
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.4s; will-change: transform;
    pointer-events: auto; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 6px;
  }
  .cosmos-label i {
    width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #bfcbe0; box-shadow: 0 0 7px rgba(190, 205, 230, 0.9);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .cosmos-label span {
    font-family: 'SF Mono', 'JetBrains Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: rgba(236, 240, 248, 0.92); white-space: nowrap;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
  }
  .cosmos-label:hover span { color: #ffd9a0; }
  .cosmos-label.egg i { background: #ffd9a0; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 200, 120, 1); }
  .cosmos-label.egg span { color: rgba(255, 224, 178, 0.95); }
  .cosmos-label.egg.found span { color: rgba(160, 205, 160, 0.9); }
  .cosmos-label.egg.reveal { opacity: 1 !important; }
  /* 屏保模式：纯净画面，一键壁纸 */
  body.cinema .hud, body.cinema .labels, body.cinema .card, body.cinema .discovery,
  body.cinema .speed-toast, body.cinema #cosmos-stick { display: none !important; }
  /* 触屏摇杆 */
  #cosmos-stick {
    position: fixed; width: 108px; height: 108px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 210, 140, 0.38);
    background: rgba(10, 14, 26, 0.25);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 12; pointer-events: none; display: none;
  }
  #cosmos-stick .knob {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%;
    width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 224, 178, 0.16);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 216, 150, 0.5);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  #cosmos-stick.look {
    border-color: rgba(120, 210, 255, 0.42);
  }
  #cosmos-stick.look .knob {
    background: rgba(178, 228, 255, 0.14);
    border-color: rgba(140, 214, 255, 0.55);
  }
</style>

<style>
  .void {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% 40%, #0a0c18 0%, #04040a 60%, #010108 100%);
    color: #e8ecf4; font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }
  #stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; touch-action: none; cursor: grab; }
  #stage:active { cursor: grabbing; }

  .hud { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10; }
  .hud::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(2, 3, 8, 0.7) 0%, transparent 14%),
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(2, 3, 8, 0.6) 0%, transparent 13%);
  }

  .hud__back {
    position: absolute; top: 18px; left: 20px;
    color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.78); font-size: 0.92rem;
    pointer-events: auto; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hud__back:hover { color: #e8384f; }

  .hud__title { position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, 0); text-align: center; }
  .hud__no { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.5); }
  .hud__title h1 {
    margin: 5px 0 3px; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.2vw, 1.9rem); letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-indent: 0.3em;
    color: #f4f7fc;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), 0 0 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  }
  .hud__seal {
    display: inline-block; width: 0.55em; height: 0.55em; margin-left: 0.5em;
    background: #ff2440; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: 0.2em;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 36, 64, 0.9);
  }
  .hud__en { font-size: 0.54rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.38); }

  /* 折叠菜单按钮（左上天体 / 右上功能） */
  .hud__fold-btn {
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.55); color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.24); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 16px; font-size: 0.84rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }
  .hud__fold-btn:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 56, 79, 0.7); color: #fff; }
  .hud__fold-btn[aria-expanded='true'] { border-color: var(--red); color: #ff8a97; }
  .dockwrap { position: absolute; top: 54px; left: 20px; pointer-events: auto; }
  .menuwrap { position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 20px; pointer-events: auto; }

  /* 右上功能菜单：竖排面板，从右上角缩放展开 */
  .hud__menu {
    position: absolute; top: 46px; right: 0; width: 148px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 10px;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.78);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.16);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    transform: scale(0.92); transform-origin: top right;
    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform 0.18s var(--ease), opacity 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .hud__menu.open { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
  .hud__menu .hud__btn { width: 100%; text-align: left; padding: 7px 10px; }

  .hud__btn {
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.55); color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.22); border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
  }
  .hud__btn:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 56, 79, 0.7); color: #fff; }
  .hud__btn[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--red); color: #ff8a97; }

  .beauty {
    position: absolute; top: 58px; right: 0; z-index: 14;
    width: 216px; padding: 14px 16px 10px;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.14);
    border-radius: 14px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .beauty__tune {
    margin: 4px 0 8px; font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.42em;
    color: rgba(255, 217, 160, 0.72);
  }
  .beauty__row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 9px;
    font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.82);
  }
  .beauty__row span { flex: 0 0 52px; }
  .beauty__row b {
    flex: 0 0 44px; text-align: right;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 217, 160, 0.9); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .beauty__row input[type='range'] {
    flex: 1; height: 3px; appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5), rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.18));
    border-radius: 2px; outline: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .beauty__row input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ffd9a0; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.6);
  }
  .beauty__row input[type='range']::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; border: none;
    background: #ffd9a0; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.6);
  }
  .beauty__row.check { justify-content: space-between; }
  .beauty__row.check span { flex: none; }
  .beauty__row input[type='checkbox'] {
    width: 15px; height: 15px; accent-color: #e8384f; cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 行星导航坞：左上角玻璃面板，从左上角缩放展开；每项带行星色点 */
  .hud__dock {
    position: absolute; top: 46px; left: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; padding: 10px 12px;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.78);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.16);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    transform: scale(0.92); transform-origin: top left;
    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform 0.18s var(--ease), opacity 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .hud__dock.open { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
  .hud__dock button {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    background: transparent; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.72); font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    padding: 5px 12px 5px 8px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.18s;
    font-family: var(--font-serif); white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .hud__dock button::before {
    content: ''; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none;
    background: var(--tint, #8a94a8);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--tint, #8a94a8);
  }
  .hud__dock button:hover { color: #ffd9a0; border-color: rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.35); }
  .hud__dock button.on { color: #ff8a97; border-color: rgba(232, 56, 79, 0.55); }

  .hud__clock {
    position: absolute; left: 20px; bottom: 18px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
  }
  .hud__speed { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #e8ecf4; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .hud__near { font-size: 0.76rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.6); }
  .hud__near b { color: #ffd9a0; font-weight: 600; }
  .hud__date { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.42); }

  .hud__score {
    position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.6); text-align: right;
  }
  .hud__score b { color: #ffd9a0; }

  .hud__hint {
    position: absolute; bottom: calc(20px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; white-space: nowrap;
    color: rgba(240, 244, 250, 0.85);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), 0 0 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    opacity: 1; transition: opacity 1.4s;
  }
  .hud__hint b { color: #ffd9a0; font-weight: 600; }
  .hud__hint.fade { opacity: 0; }

  /* 信息卡 */
  .card {
    position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 74px; width: min(300px, 86vw);
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.16);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding: 18px 18px 14px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px); z-index: 15;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .card[hidden] { display: none; }
  .card__close {
    position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 10px; background: none; border: none;
    color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.5); font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .card h2 { margin: 0 0 2px; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #f4f7fc; }
  .card__en { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.4); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .card__desc { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.8); }
  .card dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 3px 12px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .card dt { font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.45); align-self: center; }
  .card dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.74rem; color: #ffe9c4; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .card__facts { margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .card__facts li { font-size: 0.74rem; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.62); padding-left: 12px; position: relative; }
  .card__facts li::before { content: '·'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #ffd9a0; }
  .card__go {
    width: 100%; background: rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.12); color: #ffd9a0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.45); border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .card__go:hover { background: rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.22); }

  /* 发现彩蛋 */
  .discovery {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 20%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.88); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding: 16px 22px; z-index: 20;
    max-width: min(420px, 88vw); text-align: center;
    animation: disc-in 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  .discovery[hidden] { display: none; }
  .discovery__tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em; color: #ffd9a0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 12px 2px 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .discovery b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #ffe9c4; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .discovery p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.78); }
  @keyframes disc-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); } }

  .speed-toast {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 66%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #ffd9a0; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; z-index: 14;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);
  }
  .speed-toast.show { opacity: 1; }

  .theater-cap {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 9%;
    transform: translate(-50%, 14px);
    max-width: min(72vw, 620px);
    padding: 10px 26px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(2,2,8,0) 0%, rgba(2,2,8,0.42) 18%, rgba(2,2,8,0.42) 82%, rgba(2,2,8,0) 100%);
    font-family: var(--font-serif, 'Noto Serif SC', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; line-height: 1.9;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 228, 0.92);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 0 42px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.1s var(--ease), transform 1.1s var(--ease);
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 22;
  }
  .theater-cap.on { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

  /* 横屏提示 */
  .rotate {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: none;
    flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    background: #04040a; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.8);
  }
  .rotate p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); letter-spacing: 0.4em; }
  .rotate p:first-child { font-size: 2.4rem; animation: rot 2s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes rot { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0); } 50% { transform: rotate(90deg); } }
  @media (orientation: portrait) and (pointer: coarse) { .rotate { display: flex; } }

  .veil {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 40;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px;
    background: #04040a; transition: opacity 1.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .veil.lit { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .veil__orbit { position: relative; width: 56px; height: 56px; }
  .veil__orbit i {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.15);
  }
  .veil__orbit i::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: -3px; left: 50%;
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff2440;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 36, 64, 0.9);
    animation: orbit 2.2s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes orbit { from { transform: rotate(0) translateX(28px); } to { transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(28px); } }
  .veil__text { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.5); }

  .fatal {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 60;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    background: #04040a; text-align: center; padding: 24px;
  }
  .fatal[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fatal p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hud__title h1 { letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
    .hud__clock { bottom: 56px; }
    .hud__score { bottom: 34px; font-size: 0.64rem; }
    .hud__hint { font-size: 0.66rem; bottom: 78px; }
    .card { right: 12px; left: 12px; width: auto; top: auto; bottom: 90px; }
    .hud__fold-btn { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.76rem; }
    .hud__menu { width: 136px; }
    .hud__menu .hud__btn { padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 0.76rem; }
    .hud__dock button { font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 4px 10px 4px 6px; }
    .beauty { width: 196px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) { #btn-full { display: none; } }
  /* 矮横屏：天体坞双列，避开底部遥测 */
  @media (max-height: 520px) and (pointer: coarse) {
    .hud__dock.open { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, auto); gap: 2px 10px; }
    .hud__dock button { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 2px 6px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { createCosmos, type CosmosTick, type CosmosBeauty } from '../../scripts/cosmos-scene';
  import { CosmosAudio } from '../../scripts/cosmos-audio';
  import { PLANETS, SUN, MOON, MOONS, BELT_DWARFS, byKey, fmtDist, TIME_LABELS, C_SCENE } from '../../scripts/cosmos-core';

  const canvas = document.getElementById('stage') as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const veil = document.getElementById('veil')!;
  const fatal = document.getElementById('fatal')!;
  const fatalMsg = document.getElementById('fatal-msg')!;
  const hudSpeed = document.getElementById('hud-speed')!;
  const hudNear = document.getElementById('hud-near')!;
  const hudDate = document.getElementById('hud-date')!;
  const hudScore = document.getElementById('hud-score')!;
  const hudHint = document.getElementById('hud-hint')!;
  const dock = document.getElementById('dock')!;
  const card = document.getElementById('info-card')!;
  const cardName = document.getElementById('card-name')!;
  const cardEn = document.getElementById('card-en')!;
  const cardDesc = document.getElementById('card-desc')!;
  const cardData = document.getElementById('card-data')!;
  const cardFacts = document.getElementById('card-facts')!;
  const cardGo = document.getElementById('card-go') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const discovery = document.getElementById('discovery')!;
  const discoveryName = document.getElementById('discovery-name')!;
  const discoveryLine = document.getElementById('discovery-line')!;
  const speedToast = document.getElementById('speed-toast')!;
  const btnTime = document.getElementById('btn-time') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnSound = document.getElementById('btn-sound') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnFull = document.getElementById('btn-full') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnCinema = document.getElementById('btn-cinema') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnTour = document.getElementById('btn-tour') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const coarse = matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches;

  // ---- 巡航模式：自动逐站漫游，任意手动操作即退出 ----
  let tourOn = false;
  function syncTourButton() {
    btnTour.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(tourOn));
    btnTour.textContent = tourOn ? '巡航 · 开' : '巡航';
  }
  btnTour.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!handle) return;
    tourOn = !tourOn;
    handle.setTour(tourOn);
    syncTourButton();
  });

  // ---- 美观调节面板：滑杆实时生效，设置本地留存 ----
  const BEAUTY_STORE = 'opt-cosmos-beauty';
  const btnBeauty = document.getElementById('btn-beauty') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const beautyPanel = document.getElementById('beauty')!;
  const labelsEl = document.getElementById('labels')!;
  const beautyState: CosmosBeauty & { labels: boolean; belt: boolean; orbits: boolean } = {
    sun: 1, bloom: 1, halo: 1, atmo: 1, spin: 1, labels: true, belt: true, orbits: true,
  };
  const sliderMap: [string, keyof CosmosBeauty][] = [
    ['be-sun', 'sun'], ['be-bloom', 'bloom'], ['be-halo', 'halo'],
    ['be-atmo', 'atmo'], ['be-spin', 'spin'],
  ];
  btnBeauty.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const show = beautyPanel.hidden;
    beautyPanel.hidden = !show;
    btnBeauty.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(show));
    if (show) closeMenu();
  });
  function saveBeauty() {
    try { localStorage.setItem(BEAUTY_STORE, JSON.stringify(beautyState)); } catch { /* 私隐模式 */ }
  }
  for (const [id, key] of sliderMap) {
    const input = document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement;
    const readout = input.parentElement!.querySelector('b')!;
    input.addEventListener('input', () => {
      beautyState[key] = Number(input.value);
      readout.textContent = `${beautyState[key].toFixed(key === 'spin' ? 1 : 2)}×`;
      handle?.setBeauty({ [key]: beautyState[key] });
      saveBeauty();
    });
  }
  const beLabels = document.getElementById('be-labels') as HTMLInputElement;
  const beBelt = document.getElementById('be-belt') as HTMLInputElement;
  const beOrbits = document.getElementById('be-orbits') as HTMLInputElement;
  beLabels.addEventListener('change', () => {
    beautyState.labels = beLabels.checked;
    labelsEl.style.display = beLabels.checked ? '' : 'none';
    saveBeauty();
  });
  beBelt.addEventListener('change', () => {
    beautyState.belt = beBelt.checked;
    handle?.setBeltVisible(beBelt.checked);
    saveBeauty();
  });
  beOrbits.addEventListener('change', () => {
    beautyState.orbits = beOrbits.checked;
    handle?.setOrbitsVisible(beOrbits.checked);
    saveBeauty();
  });
  function restoreBeauty() {
    try {
      const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(BEAUTY_STORE) || 'null') as Partial<typeof beautyState> | null;
      if (saved) Object.assign(beautyState, saved);
    } catch { /* 私隐模式 */ }
    handle.setBeauty({
      sun: beautyState.sun, bloom: beautyState.bloom, halo: beautyState.halo,
      atmo: beautyState.atmo, spin: beautyState.spin,
    });
    handle.setBeltVisible(beautyState.belt);
    handle.setOrbitsVisible(beautyState.orbits);
    labelsEl.style.display = beautyState.labels ? '' : 'none';
    for (const [id, key] of sliderMap) {
      const input = document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement;
      input.value = String(beautyState[key]);
      const readout = input.parentElement!.querySelector('b')!;
      readout.textContent = `${beautyState[key].toFixed(key === 'spin' ? 1 : 2)}×`;
    }
    beLabels.checked = beautyState.labels;
    beBelt.checked = beautyState.belt;
    beOrbits.checked = beautyState.orbits;
  }

  // ---- 壁纸模式：隐藏全部界面，纯净画面（H 键切换） ----
  function toggleCinema() {
    const on = !document.body.classList.contains('cinema');
    document.body.classList.toggle('cinema', on);
    btnCinema.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on));
    btnCinema.textContent = on ? '壁纸 · 开' : '壁纸';
  }
  btnCinema.textContent = '壁纸';
  // 操作提示：触屏与桌面各说各话
  hudHint.innerHTML = coarse
    ? '<b>左半屏</b> 摇杆航行 · <b>右半屏</b> 拖动转视角 · <b>双指捏合</b> 调速 · <b>双击</b> 疾冲 · 点天体前往'
    : '<b>WASD</b> 航行 · <b>拖拽</b> 视角 · <b>滚轮</b> 调速 · 空格/Q 上升 · C 下降 · Shift 加速 · <b>V</b> 剧场 · <b>H</b> 壁纸 · 点击行星前往';
  btnCinema.addEventListener('click', toggleCinema);
  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('cinema')) {
    setTimeout(toggleCinema, 100); // 调试/壁纸截图：无头验证用
  }
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key.toLowerCase() === 'h' && !(e.target as HTMLElement)?.closest('button, a, input, textarea')) {
      toggleCinema();
    }
  });

  function die(msg: string) {
    fatal.hidden = false;
    fatalMsg.textContent = msg;
    document.title = `✗ ${msg || '未知错误'} · 宇宙漫游`;
    veil.classList.add('lit');
  }

  // ---- 信息卡 ----
  let selectedKey: string | null = null;
  function fillCard(key: string) {
    const moonExtra = MOONS.find((m) => m.key === key);
    if (key === 'moon') {
      cardName.textContent = MOON.name;
      cardEn.textContent = MOON.en;
      cardDesc.textContent = MOON.desc;
      cardData.innerHTML = rows([
        ['直径', `${(MOON.radiusKm * 2).toLocaleString()} km`],
        ['公转周期', `${MOON.periodDays.toFixed(2)} 天`],
        ['自转', '潮汐锁定'],
        ['轨道倾角', `${MOON.iDeg}°`],
      ]);
      cardFacts.innerHTML = MOON.facts.map((f) => `<li>${f}</li>`).join('');
    } else if (moonExtra) {
      const parent = byKey(moonExtra.parent);
      cardName.textContent = moonExtra.name;
      cardEn.textContent = moonExtra.en;
      cardDesc.textContent = moonExtra.desc;
      cardData.innerHTML = rows([
        ['直径', `${Math.round(moonExtra.radiusKm * 2).toLocaleString()} km`],
        ['所属', parent ? parent.name : '—'],
        ['公转周期', `${moonExtra.periodDays < 2 ? (moonExtra.periodDays * 24).toFixed(1) + ' 小时' : moonExtra.periodDays.toFixed(2) + ' 天'}`],
        ['尺寸比例', `${(moonExtra.radiusKm / 6371).toFixed(3)} × 地球`],
      ]);
      cardFacts.innerHTML = moonExtra.facts.map((f) => `<li>${f}</li>`).join('');
    } else if (BELT_DWARFS.some((d) => d.key === key)) {
      const b = BELT_DWARFS.find((d) => d.key === key)!;
      cardName.textContent = b.name;
      cardEn.textContent = b.en;
      cardDesc.textContent = b.desc;
      cardData.innerHTML = rows([
        ['直径', `${(b.radiusKm * 2).toLocaleString()} km`],
        ['半长轴', `${b.aAU.toFixed(3)} AU`],
        ['公转周期', `${(b.periodDays / 365.25).toFixed(1)} 年`],
        ['尺寸比例', `${(b.radiusKm / 6371).toFixed(3)} × 地球`],
      ]);
      cardFacts.innerHTML = b.facts.map((f) => `<li>${f}</li>`).join('');
    } else {
      const b = key === 'sun' ? SUN : byKey(key);
      if (!b) return;
      cardName.textContent = b.name;
      cardEn.textContent = b.en;
      cardDesc.textContent = b.desc;
      cardData.innerHTML = rows([
        ['直径', `${(b.radiusKm * 2).toLocaleString()} km`],
        ['半长轴', b.aAU ? `${b.aAU.toFixed(3)} AU` : '—'],
        ['公转周期', b.aAU ? `${b.periodDays > 900 ? (b.periodDays / 365.25).toFixed(1) + ' 年' : b.periodDays.toFixed(1) + ' 天'}` : '—'],
        ['自转周期', `${Math.abs(b.rotationHours) < 48 ? Math.abs(b.rotationHours).toFixed(1) + ' 小时' : (Math.abs(b.rotationHours) / 24).toFixed(1) + ' 天'}${b.rotationHours < 0 ? '（逆行）' : ''}`],
        ['轴倾角', `${b.tiltDeg}°`],
        ['尺寸比例', `${(b.radiusKm / 6371).toFixed(2)} × 地球`],
      ]);
      cardFacts.innerHTML = b.facts.map((f) => `<li>${f}</li>`).join('');
    }
    card.hidden = false;
  }
  const rows = (list: [string, string][]) =>
    list.map(([k, v]) => `<dt>${k}</dt><dd>${v}</dd>`).join('');

  document.getElementById('card-close')!.addEventListener('click', () => { card.hidden = true; });
  cardGo.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (selectedKey) handle.flyTo(selectedKey);
  });

  // ---- 导航坞（左上折叠菜单，带行星色点） ----
  const TINTS: Record<string, string> = {
    sun: '#ffd9a0', mercury: '#9a948e', venus: '#d9b77e', earth: '#4f8fd9', mars: '#c07a5a',
    jupiter: '#d8b58a', saturn: '#d9c9a5', uranus: '#9fd4d9', neptune: '#5478d2', pluto: '#bfae9a',
  };
  const btnDock = document.getElementById('btn-dock') as HTMLButtonElement;
  btnDock.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = dock.classList.toggle('open');
    btnDock.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    if (open) closeMenu();
  });
  const dockKeys = ['sun', ...PLANETS.map((p) => p.key)];
  dockKeys.forEach((k) => {
    const btn = document.createElement('button');
    btn.textContent = k === 'sun' ? '太阳' : byKey(k)!.name;
    btn.dataset.key = k;
    btn.style.setProperty('--tint', TINTS[k] ?? '#8a94a8');
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      handle.flyTo(k);
      dock.classList.remove('open'); // 选完即收，还视野给星空
      btnDock.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    });
    dock.appendChild(btn);
  });

  // ---- 功能菜单（右上折叠） ----
  const btnMenu = document.getElementById('btn-menu') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const menuEl = document.getElementById('menu')!;
  function closeMenu() {
    menuEl.classList.remove('open');
    btnMenu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  }
  btnMenu.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = menuEl.classList.toggle('open');
    btnMenu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    if (open) {
      beautyPanel.hidden = true;
      btnBeauty.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
      dock.classList.remove('open');
      btnDock.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    }
  });
  function markDock(key: string | null) {
    dock.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b) => b.classList.toggle('on', b.dataset.key === key));
  }

  // ---- 环境音 ----
  const audio = new CosmosAudio();
  const coarseLabel = (on: boolean) => (coarse ? (on ? '声音' : '声音') : on ? '声音 · 开' : '声音 · 关');
  btnSound.textContent = coarse ? '声音' : '声音 · 关';
  btnSound.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const on = audio.toggle();
    btnSound.textContent = coarseLabel(on);
    btnSound.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on));
  });
  btnFull.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (document.fullscreenElement) void document.exitFullscreen();
    else void document.documentElement.requestFullscreen().catch(() => {});
  });

  // ---- 拍照 / 光速 / 弹弓 / 陀螺仪 / 剧场 ----
  const btnTheater = document.getElementById('btn-theater') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const theaterCap = document.getElementById('theater-cap')!;
  let theaterOn = false;
  function syncTheaterButton() {
    btnTheater.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(theaterOn));
    btnTheater.textContent = theaterOn ? '剧场 · 开' : '剧场';
  }
  btnTheater.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!handle) return;
    if (theaterOn) handle.cancelTheater();
    else handle.startTheater();
  });
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if ((e.target as HTMLElement)?.closest('button, a, input, textarea')) return;
    if (e.key.toLowerCase() === 'v' && !e.repeat && handle) {
      if (theaterOn) handle.cancelTheater();
      else handle.startTheater();
    }
  });

  const btnPhoto = document.getElementById('btn-photo') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnLight = document.getElementById('btn-light') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnSling = document.getElementById('btn-sling') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnGyro = document.getElementById('btn-gyro') as HTMLButtonElement;

  function takePhoto() {
    if (!handle) return;
    const url = handle.snapshot();
    const img = new Image();
    img.onload = () => {
      const cv = document.createElement('canvas');
      cv.width = img.width;
      cv.height = img.height;
      const g = cv.getContext('2d')!;
      g.drawImage(img, 0, 0);
      const pad = Math.round(cv.width * 0.02);
      const fs = Math.max(12, Math.round(cv.width * 0.013));
      g.font = `${fs}px "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace`;
      g.fillStyle = 'rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.82)';
      g.textAlign = 'right';
      const lines = [
        `宇宙漫游 · 最近 ${lastTick ? lastTick.nearest : '深空'}`,
        lastTick?.nearLight ?? '',
        hudDate.textContent ?? '',
      ].filter(Boolean);
      lines.forEach((ln, i) => {
        g.fillText(ln, cv.width - pad, cv.height - pad - (lines.length - 1 - i) * Math.round(fs * 1.5));
      });
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = cv.toDataURL('image/png');
      a.download = `cosmos-${Date.now()}.png`;
      a.click();
      showToast('照片已导出');
    };
    img.src = url;
  }
  btnPhoto.addEventListener('click', takePhoto);
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if ((e.target as HTMLElement)?.closest('button, a, input, textarea')) return;
    if (e.key.toLowerCase() === 'p' && !e.repeat) takePhoto();
  });
  btnLight.addEventListener('click', () => handle?.setLightSpeed(!lightOn));
  btnSling.addEventListener('click', () => handle?.slingshot());

  // 陀螺仪视差：转动手机环顾深空（仅触屏设备显示）
  if (coarse && typeof DeviceOrientationEvent !== 'undefined') {
    btnGyro.hidden = false;
    let gyroOn = false;
    let baseA: number | null = null;
    let baseB = 0;
    let yawT = 0, pitchT = 0, yawC = 0, pitchC = 0;
    const onOrient = (ev: DeviceOrientationEvent) => {
      if (!gyroOn || ev.alpha == null || ev.beta == null) return;
      if (baseA === null) { baseA = ev.alpha; baseB = ev.beta; return; }
      let da = ev.alpha - baseA;
      da = ((da + 180) % 360 + 360) % 360 - 180;
      yawT = Math.max(-1.1, Math.min(1.1, -da * Math.PI / 180 * 0.6));
      pitchT = Math.max(-0.6, Math.min(0.6, (ev.beta - baseB) * Math.PI / 180 * 0.5));
    };
    btnGyro.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!gyroOn) {
        try {
          const anyDOE = DeviceOrientationEvent as unknown as { requestPermission?: () => Promise<string> };
          if (anyDOE.requestPermission && (await anyDOE.requestPermission()) !== 'granted') return;
          window.addEventListener('deviceorientation', onOrient);
          gyroOn = true;
          baseA = null;
        } catch { /* 用户拒绝 */ }
      } else {
        gyroOn = false;
        window.removeEventListener('deviceorientation', onOrient);
        handle?.setTilt(0, 0);
      }
      btnGyro.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(gyroOn));
    });
    const gyroLoop = () => {
      if (gyroOn) {
        yawC += (yawT - yawC) * 0.08;
        pitchC += (pitchT - pitchC) * 0.08;
        handle?.setTilt(yawC, pitchC);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(gyroLoop);
    };
    gyroLoop();
  }

  let toastTimer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;
  let lastSpeedShown = -1;
  let lightOn = false;
  let lastTick: CosmosTick | null = null; // 拍照水印用

  function showToast(text: string) {
    speedToast.textContent = text;
    speedToast.classList.add('show');
    if (toastTimer) clearTimeout(toastTimer);
    toastTimer = setTimeout(() => speedToast.classList.remove('show'), 1600);
  }

  function onTick(t: CosmosTick) {
    lastTick = t;
    const sp = Math.round(t.speed);
    const cMult = t.speed / C_SCENE;
    const speedLine = cMult >= 1
      ? `航速 ${sp} u/s · ${Math.round(cMult).toLocaleString()}×光速`
      : `航速 ${sp} u/s`;
    if (speedLine !== hudSpeed.textContent) hudSpeed.textContent = speedLine;
    void lastSpeedShown;
    hudNear.innerHTML = `最近 <b>${t.nearest}</b> · ${fmtDist(t.nearestDist)}${t.nearLight ? ` · ${t.nearLight}` : ''}`;
    const date = new Date(Date.UTC(2000, 0, 1) + t.simDays * 86400000);
    hudDate.textContent = `宇宙历 ${date.getUTCFullYear()}.${String(date.getUTCMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}.${String(date.getUTCDate()).padStart(2, '0')}`;
    hudScore.innerHTML = t.eggsFound > 0
      ? `漂浮物 <b>${t.eggsFound} / ${t.eggsTotal}</b>`
      : `漂浮物 0 / ${t.eggsTotal} · 宇宙某处`;
    markDock(t.autopilot);
    if (t.tour !== tourOn) { // 手动操作可能已在场景内退出巡航，按钮跟随
      tourOn = t.tour;
      syncTourButton();
    }
    if (t.lightMode !== lightOn) {
      lightOn = t.lightMode;
      btnLight.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(lightOn));
      btnLight.textContent = lightOn ? '光速 · 开' : '光速航行';
    }
    if (t.theater !== theaterOn) {
      theaterOn = t.theater;
      syncTheaterButton();
    }
    if (t.autopilot && t.autopilot !== selectedKey) {
      selectedKey = t.autopilot;
      fillCard(t.autopilot);
    }
    audio.setWind(Math.min(t.speed / 900, 1));
  }

  function webgl2OK(): boolean {
    try { return !!canvas.getContext('webgl2'); } catch { return false; }
  }

  let handle!: ReturnType<typeof createCosmos>;
  try {
    if (!webgl2OK()) {
      die('此浏览器不支持 WebGL2，引擎无法点火。');
    } else {
      handle = createCosmos(canvas, {
        labels: document.getElementById('labels'),
        onTick,
        onReady: () => {
          veil.classList.add('lit');
          setTimeout(() => veil.remove(), 1400);
          setTimeout(() => hudHint.classList.add('fade'), 14000);
        },
        onDiscover: (_key, name, line) => {
          discoveryName.textContent = name;
          discoveryLine.textContent = line;
          discovery.hidden = false;
          audio.chime();
          setTimeout(() => { discovery.hidden = true; }, 7000);
        },
        onSelect: (key) => {
          if (key) { selectedKey = key; fillCard(key); }
          else { card.hidden = true; selectedKey = null; }
          markDock(key);
        },
        onSpeedToast: (s) => {
          showToast(`航速 ${Math.round(s)} u/s`);
        },
        onEvent: (text) => {
          showToast(text);
        },
        onCaption: (text) => {
          if (text) {
            theaterCap.textContent = text;
            theaterCap.classList.add('on');
          } else {
            theaterCap.classList.remove('on');
          }
        },
      });
      btnTime.textContent = TIME_LABELS[2];
      btnTime.addEventListener('click', () => {
        btnTime.textContent = TIME_LABELS[handle.cycleTime()];
      });
      restoreBeauty();
    }
  } catch (err) {
    die(err instanceof Error ? `${err.message}` : String(err));
  }

  addEventListener('error', (e) => {
    if (!fatal.hidden) return;
    die(e.message || '未知的故障');
  });
</script>
